CoWSwapLeaves
├── Direct native calls
│   ├── Pre-sign and cancel as the adapter without installing a capability
│   ├── Keep token approval independent from signing and cancellation
│   └── Keep previously signed orders valid until explicitly cancelled
└── Merkle authorization
    ├── Allow digest and expiry changes with the reusable signing leaf
    ├── Reject changes to owner, selector, ABI offsets, length, padding or signed flag
    ├── Reject settlement substitution
    ├── Require the caller's leaf role
    └── Reject another order when the UID is fixed
